{{ill|Mitsuya Kofun|ja|三津屋古墳}} is a [[Kofun]] in Japan. Specifically, it is an {{ill|Octagonal Kofun|lt=Octagonal Kofun|ja|八角墳}}.<ref name=":0">{{Cite web |date=2015-09-07 |title=Mitsuya Kofun [三津屋古墳] Passage Grave : The Megalithic Portal and Megalith Map |url=https://www.megalithic.co.uk/article.php?sid=31732 |access-date=2023-10-20 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150907095743/https://www.megalithic.co.uk/article.php?sid=31732 |archive-date=2015-09-07 }}</ref> The inner chamber is open to the public.<ref name=":0" />

